# Cava Audio Visualizer Notes
Audio spectrum visualizer used with YASB status bar.

## Installation
Install via Winget:
```powershell
winget install cava

Required Dependency
Cava requires msvcr110.dll to run properly on Windows.
Download the file from: https://www.dll-files.com/msvcr110.dll.html
Place msvcr110.dll directly inside your Cava program directory
